Package: schema
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: schema compiler for game network data
 schema compiles declarative data-type definitions into serialization
 code for C, C++, C#, Go, Rust and JavaScript. One declaration produces
 the reader and the writer in every target language, bit-identical on
 the wire, so they cannot drift. Values are bit-packed from declared
 ranges, and reads validate: out-of-range data is refused, not clamped.
 .
 This package contains the schema command-line compiler, a single
 statically linked binary. The code it generates is not covered by the
 compiler's license — see /usr/share/doc/schema/copyright.
